# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. Reproduces production before #4675 (#4549):
# #4647 reconciles only source-origin entries, so r's own value that s applied and
# then deleted, behind a detach, survives the re-seed after s reaped the delete.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceForeignRowNotReconciled
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the reconcile covers only entries the source authored, so a receiver-local value whose delete the source reaped survives
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
           ok == okSrc \/ okFor
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no reconcile for an entry of another origin.
           ok == okSrc
--- END
